	<key>readme</key>
	<string>ghfh, ghfhtm and ghp open a repo in Function-Health, Function-Health-Terraform-Modules and nickolashkraus. ghpr &lt;repo&gt; [number] opens a Function-Health pull request (or the list without a number); pass owner/repo for another owner, and repo#number also works. A repo is a short name (sre, mjs, mam, ts, memb or ms, ppp, ent, admin, fe, agent-os) or the name, a prefix, the initials or a substring of a local clone. Every match is listed, and Tab completes the selected one.</string>
